hnsbi-toolkit
=============

The statistical design and example implementations were developed alongside
the hybrid neural density-estimation project.

Portions of the flow, streaming-data, and ratio-integration design are adapted
from the MIT-licensed `nsbi-lhc-toolkit` project:

  Copyright (c) 2025-present Jay Sandesara
  https://github.com/iris-hep/nsbi-lhc-toolkit

The upstream nsbi-lhc-toolkit remains a runtime integration rather than being
vendored here. The canonical `iris-hep/nsbi-lhc-toolkit` `main` branch is
installed as the `nsbi_common_utils` library. Its classifier training,
calibration diagnostics, workspace model, and JAX/Minuit inference interfaces
are used where applicable.
